## 3. TypeScript & Path Aliases Rules

### Strict Compiler Compliance
- The project enforces strict TypeScript settings:
  - `"verbatimModuleSyntax": true` (use `import type { ... }` for type-only imports)
  - `"erasableSyntaxOnly": true`
  - `"noUnusedLocals": true`
  - `"noUnusedParameters": true`
  - `"strict": true`

### Path Aliases Mandate (NO Relative `../` Traversal)
All imports across TypeScript and SCSS must use path aliases. Relative parent traversal (`../../`) is strictly prohibited:

| Alias | Target Directory / File | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `@purity/core` | `src/framework/core.ts` | Framework core barrel export |
| `@purity/*` | `src/framework/*` | Specific framework modules |
| `@environments` | `src/environments/environment.ts` | Environment configuration profile |
| `@environments/*` | `src/environments/*` | Environment interfaces & profiles |
| `@data/*` | `src/data/*` | Data services, themes, notifications |
| `@app/*` | `src/app/*` | Application root files & components |
| `@pages/*` | `src/app/pages/*` | Application pages and view showcases |
| `@shared/*` | `src/app/shared/*` | Shared application assets & modules |
| `@components/*` | `src/app/shared/components/*` | Reusable UI Web Components |
| `@directives/*` | `src/app/shared/directives/*` | Custom DOM directives |
| `@pipes/*` | `src/app/shared/pipes/*` | Transform pipes |
| `@validators/*` | `src/app/shared/validators/*` | Form and field validators |
| `@behaviors/*` | `src/app/shared/behaviors/*` | Composable DOM behaviors |
| `@interceptors/*` | `src/app/shared/interceptors/*` | Centralized HTTP interceptor classes |
| `@widgets/*` | `src/app/shared/widgets/*` | Standalone UI widgets |
| `@external/*` | `src/app/external/*` | External loaders and third-party adapters |
| `@styles` | `src/styles/index.scss` | Master SCSS design system barrel |

### Side-Effect Imports for Decorators
Because `@Component`, `@Directive`, `@Pipe`, and `@Validator` auto-register at module evaluation time, import them as side-effects:
```typescript
import '@pages/my-feature/my-feature.component';
import '@directives/my-feature.directive';
import '@pipes/my-feature.pipe';
import '@validators/my-feature.validator';
```

