## 5. Naming Conventions

| Entity | Pattern | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Files** | `kebab-case.role.ts` | `auth.interceptor.ts`, `date-time-picker.component.ts`, `highlight.directive.ts`, `user-form.validator.ts`, `_variables.scss` |
| **Component Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Component` | `AppComponent`, `DateTimePickerComponent`, `DemoComponent` |
| **Custom Element Tags** | `kebab-case` (multi-word) | `<app-component>`, `<date-time-picker>`, `<router-layout>`, `<analogue-clock>` |
| **Service Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Service` | `ThemeService`, `NotifyService`, `DataService` |
| **Interceptor Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Interceptor` | `AuthInterceptor`, `LoggingInterceptor` |
| **Directive Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Directive` | `HighlightDirective`, `TooltipDirective` |
| **Pipe Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Pipe` | `DatePipe`, `UppercasePipe`, `TransformSamplePipe` |
| **Validator Classes** | `PascalCase` + `Validator` | `FormsValidationValidator`, `UserRegistrationValidator` |
| **Signals & Methods** | `camelCase` | `currentUser`, `selectedDate`, `onInit()`, `onDestroy()`, `validateField()` |
| **Interfaces & Types** | `PascalCase` | `HttpRequest`, `HttpResponse`, `CanActivateFn`, `Route` |
| **CSS Classes** | `kebab-case` | `.button-primary`, `.input-primary`, `.window`, `.is-valid`, `.is-invalid` |

